<description>&lt;p&gt;Explosives attacks on the Colombia-Venezuela border have wounded police officers and injured additional officers in separate bomb blasts. Former Cucuta security chief Miguel Castellanos was shot dead in a political assassination. An extortion-linked assault in Colombia killed at least six people. Colombian forces have killed ten ELN guerrillas in Cauca and another ten in a separate operation, and President De la Espriella announced the death of two ELN leaders. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQN1RPNGRmY3VhQkZ3TkRJSmVLQnk4eHhDOTFkdERzNUJKRE16cFVmZXJLVGVNSW1rbnBqeEtoY1dycmlJZHhtRWhubUZUT3hpaDRya2FodWZtcHIyVDhBRF9XR1dyLU9NRi1oOGRvQ3E1NlRzeHk1UEpncVUzemktYk5qTWtWYk9v?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Corsicana Daily Sun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQUS14YnE1YWlfUXpwNW5oVjRKbTVGR0ZOZmQ2eWZjRlhibG93MlV2SWhuQVQtc253OWNpeDFBRkdJRlpmZTMzOFZoeEo2cXVrMTVXZ3lOckZ0SHZqZ2I1cG1TM0tWRmVxYkJPcUc4SWhCNm1nci1yVV9WbDFsV09CYzZ0UC10OVBlSmFoa2J2bEg3OTFCcGc0N2ozdTJOZlpsZ2xB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOMXhFNXR2SWZUVWFHdGsyNldKaTR2SDFtZEF1MWlZZ3Rud25LaDAwNE9WX3dfU1V1dHZxaDhiRVlvTHNIVWt1WElaVC1BQzJwbDRkakZiMUxGQmZyTE9Yb2EydFFXeUJGbjJQVXNFVnNVN3d5cHhCQ0ZVdEp6M0xqUUE5VTdGUFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNVXVoN2lBLW1KSmVzUnlOMno1TXBOZ29mcUE1RjRMTktLYVNoalZjSDFCRy1uaXVTSHN4ZWNxNFQxTmNYTU5mV0haZmpkc2ZOdDMxYXpSWXJqY2ZRaGNVUFFYcVpPT19YSEFxaWhKZ0NQTTB0MU5NM0tiSTBONDNOcjdJamZtX3Z0SE